msgid "Specify the hardware video decoding API that should be used if possible. Whether hardware decoding is actually done depends on the video codec. If hardware decoding is not possible, mpv will fall back on software decoding. Hardware decoding is disabled by default to maintain reliability. However, modern hardware should support hardware video decoding, reducing CPU usage and power consumption.\\n\\nFor more information visit:"
msgstr "Specify the hardware video decoding API that should be used if possible. Whether hardware decoding is actually done depends on the video codec. If hardware decoding is not possible, mpv will fall back on software decoding. Hardware decoding is disabled by default to maintain reliability. However, modern hardware should support hardware video decoding, reducing CPU usage and power consumption.\\n\\nFür weitere Informationen besuchen Sie:"

msgid "Specify the sub font size. The unit is the size in scaled pixels at a window height of 720. The actual pixel size is scaled with the window height: if the window height is larger or smaller than 720, the actual size of the text increases or decreases as well. Default: 55"
msgstr "Geben Sie die untere Schriftgröße an. Die Einheit ist die Größe in skalierten Pixeln in einer Fensterhöhe von 720. Die tatsächliche Pixelgröße wird mit der Fensterhöhe skaliert: Wenn die Fensterhöhe größer oder kleiner als 720 ist, nimmt auch die tatsächliche Größe des Textes zu oder nimmt ab. Standard: 55"

